    r += 1

    r = heading("Caveats", r)
    r = para("• Market-implied, not fundamental: ratings, price, and spread reflect what the market has already "
             "priced in on each file's 'as of' date. This is not a leverage/coverage-based default probability "
             "model, and it is not a forecast.", r)
    r = para("• Single snapshot per region: all index figures reflect one point in time for that region. "
             "Re-running against newer exports will move rankings, sometimes sharply, especially for names with "
